ation has certain content and visual limitations. We will try to showcase the concept in the best possible way within those constraints.</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;font-weight:bold;margin:12pt 0 3pt 0;'>Scene 1 (Hook)</p><div style='margin-left:14pt;'><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>Visual:</b> Creator looks into camera with mild annoyance while holding the <a href='https://suroskie.com/products/glow-up-juice-spf-35-pa-rice-rose-dewy-spf-toner-mist'>Glow Up Juice Spf 35 PA++++ Rice &amp; Rose Dewy Spf Toner Mist</a> pink spray bottle.</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>VO:</b> “Sticky sunscreen ruins everything.”</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>On-screen text:</b> Sticky sunscreen ruins everything</p></div><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;font-weight:bold;margin:12pt 0 3pt 0;'>Scene 2 (Packaging &amp; Spec Check)</p><div style='margin-left:14pt;'><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>Visual:</b> Creator turns the <a href='https://suroskie.com/products/glow-up-juice-spf-35-pa-rice-rose-dewy-spf-toner-mist'>Glow Up Juice Spf 35 PA++++ Rice &amp; Rose Dewy Spf Toner Mist</a> pink bottle to display the printed details.</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>VO:</b> “This mist combines sunscreen and hydrator.”</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>On-screen text:</b> SPF 35 PA++++ | 100 ml</p></div><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;font-weight:bold;margin:12pt 0 3pt 0;'>Scene 3 (Spray Test)</p><div style='margin-left:14pt;'><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>Visual:</b> Creator holds the <a href='https://suroskie.com/products/glow-up-juice-spf-35-pa-rice-rose-dewy-spf-toner-mist'>Glow Up Juice Spf 35 PA++++ Rice &amp; Rose Dewy Spf Toner Mist</a> bottle 6 to 8 inches from face and presses pump, releasing an even mist across cheekbones.</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>VO:</b> “Hold six inches back and spray.”</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>On-screen text:</b> Hold 6 to 8 inches away</p></div><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;font-weight:bold;margin:12pt 0 3pt 0;'>Scene 4 (Texture Proof)</p><div style='margin-left:14pt;'><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>Visual:</b> Creator taps cheek lightly with fingers, showing fast absorption with no oily shine on skin.</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>VO:</b> “It sinks in without feeling sticky or heavy.”</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>On-screen text:</b> No sticky or heavy feel</p></div><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;font-weight:bold;margin:12pt 0 3pt 0;'>Scene 5 (Hydration Benefit)</p><div style='margin-left:14pt;'><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>Visual:</b> Creator holds the pink bottle near cheek and gently strokes skin, showing hydrated skin feel.</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>VO:</b> “Rose extract and hyaluronic acid keep skin soft.”</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>On-screen text:</b> Rose Extract + Hyaluronic Acid</p></div><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;font-weight:bold;margin:12pt 0 3pt 0;'>Scene 6 (Dewy Payoff)</p><div style='margin-left:14pt;'><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>Visual:</b> Creator turns face toward soft window sunlight, showing fresh radiance along cheekbones.</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>VO:</b> “You get fresh radiance instantly.”</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>On-screen text:</b> Instant fresh radiance</p></div><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;font-weight:bold;margin:12pt 0 3pt 0;'>Scene 7 (All-Day Comfort &amp; Price)</p><div style='margin-left:14pt;'><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>Visual:</b> Creator snaps pink cap back onto the bottle with an audible click sound and smiles approvingly.</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>VO:</b> “It stays dewy all day for seven forty nine.”</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>On-screen text:</b> Rs. 749.00 regular price</p></div><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;font-weight:bold;margin:12pt 0 3pt 0;'>Scene 8 (Verdict &amp; CTA)</p><div style='margin-left:14pt;'><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>Visual:</b> Creator holds the boxed <a href='https://suroskie.com/products/glow-up-juice-spf-35-pa-rice-rose-dewy-spf-toner-mist'>Glow Up Juice Spf 35 PA++++ Rice &amp; Ros